`send-sms-twilio` was the only auth hook function missing webhook signature verification, unlike `send-sms-brevo` and `send-whatsapp-brevo` which both implement it. This left the endpoint unauthenticated and inconsistent with the other hooks.

## Changes

- **`supabase/functions/send-sms-twilio/index.ts`**
  - Added `verifyHookSignature()` — HMAC-SHA256 constant-time verification of the `x-supabase-signature: v1=<base64>` header against `SEND_SMS_HOOK_SECRET` (`v1,whsec_<base64>` format)
  - Added the verification block in the request handler: rejects with `401` on invalid signature; logs a warning and skips if `SEND_SMS_HOOK_SECRET` is not set (non-breaking for existing deployments)

```typescript
const hookSecret = Deno.env.get("SEND_SMS_HOOK_SECRET");
if (hookSecret) {
  const valid = await verifyHookSignature(new Uint8Array(rawBody), sigHeader, hookSecret);
  if (!valid) {
    return new Response(JSON.stringify({ error: "Invalid webhook signature" }), { status: 401 });
  }
} else {
  console.warn("[send-sms-twilio] SEND_SMS_HOOK_SECRET is not set – skipping signature verification");
}
```

**Required secret to add** in Supabase Dashboard → Edge Functions → Secrets:
- `SEND_SMS_HOOK_SECRET` — full value `v1,whsec_<base64>` from the Auth Hooks dashboard

Emergency alert was only sending SMS to one contact despite claiming it sent to all. SMS drafts opened sequentially but weren't properly awaited, causing early termination.

## Changes

**SMS delivery (lines 35-52)**
- Replaced recursive `openNext` with `sendToAllContacts` using `Promise.all()`
- Each SMS draft opens via promise with 1.5s stagger
- All sends properly awaited before completion

**Success messaging (lines 99-101)**
- Shows `"Sent to all X contacts"` when complete vs misleading `"Sending to X contacts"`
- Real-time progress: `"Sending to 3 contacts (2/3)"`
- Accurate singular/plural handling

**Code example:**
```javascript
const sendToAllContacts = async (phones, locationLine) => {
  const body = buildBody(locationLine);
  const sendPromises = phones.map((phone, index) => {
    return new Promise((resolve) => {
      setTimeout(() => {
        window.open(`sms:${phone}${separator}body=${body}`, '_blank');
        setCurrentContactIndex(index + 1);
        resolve();
      }, index * 1500);
    });
  });
  await Promise.all(sendPromises);
};
```

